    <h2>Entrepreneurship 🚀</h2>
    <p>Since I’m a child, I have been building digital projects, building my first website at the age of 11. I built dozens of different projects by now, some were just for fun, some worked out.</p>

    <h2>Travel ✈️</h2>
    <p>I was born and grew up in North Germany. With 19, I booked a one-way ticket to Bangkok to see the world. Planned was 1 year, but after 2 weeks I had a startup idea and decided to work on it abroad. I ended up traveling around the world for 5 years, while working online.</p>
    <p>So far, I had the chance to travel almost <strong>50 countries</strong>, visit 5 continents, and live for 1+ years in each Vietnam, Portugal, Taiwan, and of course Germany.</p>
    <p>Now, I’m still traveling regularly, however, I’ve settled and do so much slower.</p>

    <h2>Home 🏠</h2>
    <p>In 2023, I’ve chosen <strong>Kaohsiung, Taiwan</strong>, to become my main home. It’s incredibly modern with one of the best health care and safety in the world. People are kind, the nature is beautiful, and everyday life is easy here.</p>
    <p>Every year I spend my summers in my hometown in <strong>Porta Westfalica, Germany</strong> to be with my family there. The mix is great, as you get the best of both countries and it never gets boring.</p>
